  "question": {
    "text": "For $0 < \\theta < \\frac{\\pi}{2}$, the solution(s) of $\\sum_{m=1}^6 \\operatorname{cosec}\\left[\\theta+\\frac{(m-1) \\pi}{4}\\right]$ $\\operatorname{cosec}\\left(\\theta+\\frac{m \\pi}{4}\\right)=4 \\sqrt{2}$ is/are",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "MgLO9",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$\n",
